# fixedbugs, defect 2052, 2026-10-13, a name clang can suggest nothing for.
#
# SYMPTOM: a header of the program's own calling `undeclared_eight`, which
# nothing declares or defines, built, and the link stopped at exit 2,
# `internal error: linking failed`, as the reproducer did.
#
# FIX: `-Wimplicit-function-declaration` stays an error in the region
# (`emit/header_region.hero`'s `KEPT`), the header refused at the call's
# line 3, exit 1, before any link.

extern "fixedbugs-2052-a-header-that-calls-a-function-nobody-declared-is-refused.h"  #~ ffi_header_refused
    function eight() -> i32

function main()
    print(eight())
